    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "A Rare Opportunity to Create Your Dream Coastal Retreat.\r\n\r\nMcDonnell Properties are delighted to present No. 5 Rockfield Park, an exceptional opportunity to acquire a detached coastal residence in one of Brittas Bay’s most exclusive and sought-after private developments. \r\nOccupying a generous and commanding site with spectacular, uninterrupted sea views, this property offers endless potential for those seeking to create a stunning seaside home or holiday retreat. While the house is currently vacant and requires complete refurbishment, it qualifies for the Vacant Property Refurbishment Grant, making it an exciting prospect for buyers looking to restore and transform a home in an unrivalled coastal set-ting.\r\nOne of just 32 detached homes within this prestigious development, No. 5 enjoys an enviable position with an historic pathway leading directly from the property to the private residence beach, allowing you to enjoy the golden sands and breathtaking coastline of Brittas Bay just moments from your doorstep.\r\n\r\nDesigned to embrace its exceptional surroundings, the spacious living room features wall to wall patio doors framing magnificent sea views and opening onto a sunny patio, creating the perfect space for relaxing or entertaining. The heart of the home is the kitchen and dining area, complete with feature archways and charming exposed timber roof beams that complement its coastal character.\r\n\r\nRockfield Park also benefits from excellent communal amenities, including a children’s playground and football pitch, making it an ideal location for families and holidaymak-ers alike. Despite its peaceful setting, the property is located less than an hour’s drive from Dublin, offering the perfect escape from city life while remaining easily accessible.\r\n\r\nWhether you’re searching for a rewarding renovation project, a weekend retreat or a long term investment in one of Wicklow’s most desirable coastal locations, No. 5 Rockfield Park presents a truly unique opportunity with the ability to be transformed into its former glory. \r\n\r\n\r\nAccommodation\r\n•\tEntrance Hall – 1.2m x 1.8m\r\n\r\n•\tLiving Room – 6.4m x 3.6m\r\n\r\nDouble-aspect room with wall-to-wall patio doors opening onto the sunny patio and enjoying spectacular sea views.\r\n•\tKitchen – 3.9m x 2.5m\r\n\r\nGalley-style kitchen with fitted units and feature archways.\r\n\r\n•\tBathroom – 2.3m x 1.8m\r\n\r\n•\tBedroom 1 – 3.0m x 3.6m\r\n\r\n•\tBedroom 2 – 3.6m x 3.2m\r\n\r\n•\tBedroom 3 – 3.8m x 4.3m\r\n\r\nFeatures\r\n•\tDetached property in an exclusive private development\r\n•\tOne of only 32 detached homes\r\n•\tMagnificent panoramic sea views\r\n•\tDirect access via pathway to a private residents’ beach\r\n•\tQualifies for the Vacant Property Refurbishment Grant (subject to eligibility)\r\n•\tExcellent renovation and investment opportunity\r\n•\tSunny patio area\r\n•\tChildren’s playground and football pitch within the development\r\n•\tLess than one hour from Dublin\r\n•\tPrime Brittas Bay coastal location"
      },
      {
